# So sánh Authentication vs Authorization

| Aspect | Authentication | Authorization |
|--------|----------------|---------------|
| **Question** | "Who are you?" | "What can you do?" |
| **Purpose** | Verify identity | Grant/deny access |
| **Methods** | Password, MFA, OAuth, Biometrics | RBAC, ABAC, Permissions, Scopes |
| **Data** | User credentials, tokens | Roles, policies, permissions |
| **Errors** | 401 Unauthorized | 403 Forbidden |
| **Layer** | Pre-authorization | Post-authentication |

